                                        "entry_id": "ba7ba06d-0980-33a2-9005-d7e387f0c70a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Free from dangerous objects, as a zone in an airport that can be only be entered via a security checkpoint."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e43c4795-9816-3631-842c-918c2e4a4647",
                                        "entry_id": "ba7ba06d-0980-33a2-9005-d7e387f0c70a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of weapons: foreign-made and untraceable to the United States."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3211f25b-9038-41df-bed0-3450b87bdb08",
                                                "sense_id": "e43c4795-9816-3631-842c-918c2e4a4647",
                                                "text": "An early CIA decision was to bring war surplus in Europe to the United States, rather than let it fall into the hands of left-wing movements. Some of the guns would also, it was reasoned, be useful as \"sterile\" weapons (foreign-made and untraceable to the United States) to be provided secretly to foreign friends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "687ab901-21f8-4a6c-95f3-286a2d850acf",
                                                "sense_id": "e43c4795-9816-3631-842c-918c2e4a4647",
                                                "text": "In addition to this rapid supply system, the US Army Counterinsurgency Support Office on Okinawa helped procure special equipment including rucksacks, special rations for irregular troops, 'sterile' weapons which could not be traced to the USA and other items not procurable through foreign channels."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
